---
title: "flush (Sui Framework: token)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_amount: amount = self.spent_balance.value()
    q_get_amount --> q_split: balance = self.spent_balance.split(amount)
    q_split --> q_decrease: cap.supply_mut().decrease_supply(balance)
    q_decrease --> [*]: return amount (total supply decreased)

    note right of q_decrease
        INV-001: requires TreasuryCap - only token creator can flush
        INV-002: total_supply decreases by flushed amount
        INV-003: spent_balance in policy reset to 0
        INV-004: flush is the only way to actually reduce supply from spent tokens
    end note
